            "text": "<p>Heal contains a medium-high range polyphenol 100% Arbequina olive from Central California.<br/><br/><strong>Uses</strong> - Consume daily by the spoonful for gut health and anti-inflammatory properties. Use as a finishing oil to elevate the flavor of any dish. Also cooks well in heat.<br/></p><ul><li><strong>Single Origin</strong> - Central California</li><li><strong>Single Varietal</strong> - 100% Arbequina Olives</li><li><strong>Flavor Profile</strong> - Peppery, bright and full bodied.<br/><br/></li></ul>",
